WEBVTT

00:06.907 --> 00:08.777
<b>Sludge Atou</b>

00:06.907 --> 00:08.777
<b>Strength: 3</b>

00:06.907 --> 00:08.777
<b>Movement: 3</b>

00:20.687 --> 00:21.667
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

00:22.137 --> 00:23.257
<b><i>What?</i></b>

00:25.527 --> 00:26.737
<b><i>What's going on?</i></b>

00:32.837 --> 00:34.137
<b><i>Where am I?</i></b>

00:42.317 --> 00:44.117
<b><i>The air smells so fresh.</i></b>

00:44.797 --> 00:46.727
<b>Are you awake?</b>

00:48.287 --> 00:48.997
<b>Huh?</b>

00:53.007 --> 00:54.157
<b>Is that you,</b>

00:54.627 --> 00:55.917
<b>Atou?</b>

00:57.217 --> 01:00.097
<b>Yes, my king.</b>

02:37.677 --> 02:40.557
<b><i>The game I played in my sickbed</i></b>

02:40.557 --> 02:45.317
<b><i>was a 4X strategy game set 
in a dark fantasy world,</i></b>

02:40.557 --> 02:46.977
m 0 0 l 250 0 250 113 0 113

02:40.557 --> 02:46.977
m 0 0 l 150 0 150 2 0 2

02:40.557 --> 02:46.977
<b>Sludge Atou</b>

02:40.557 --> 02:46.977
<b>Combat Unit</b>

02:40.557 --> 02:46.977
<b>Strength: 3 Movement: 1
 Ruin Affinity +2
 Darkness Affinity +1
 Chaos Affinity +1
 Evil  Hero  Zealot</b>

02:40.557 --> 02:46.977
*This unit has a set chance of obtaining the abilities
 of units it defeats.

02:40.557 --> 02:46.977
<b>Description</b>

02:40.557 --> 02:46.977
Atou is one of Mynoghra's Hero units.
 Though she is extremely weak at the start of the game,
 and in certain circumstances proves inferior to even 
common units, she possesses powerful affinities that 
more than make up for that.
 Furthermore, she is able to acquire the abilities of 
defeated units, granting her the greatest potential for
 growth amongst all Hero units.

02:45.317 --> 02:46.977
<b><i></i>Eternal Nations<i>.</i></b>

02:47.537 --> 02:52.027
<b><i>The character I loved the most 
from that game I loved the most,</i></b>

02:52.737 --> 02:54.197
<b><i>was this woman:</i></b>

02:54.557 --> 02:55.477
<b><i>Atou.</i></b>

02:55.887 --> 02:56.757
<b><i>King.</i></b>

02:57.507 --> 02:59.367
<b><i>W-What should I do?!</i></b>

02:59.367 --> 03:00.647
<b><i>Should I act the part?</i></b>

03:00.647 --> 03:01.717
<b><i>If she's calling me king,</i></b>

03:01.717 --> 03:04.127
<b><i>then I think she means 
the leader of Mynoghra...</i></b>

03:05.837 --> 03:09.087
<b>It's all right, King Takuto.</b>

03:10.677 --> 03:13.727
<b>You're the one who achieved the 
feat of clearing nightmare difficulty!</b>

03:13.727 --> 03:17.337
<b>All while using the civilization said to be the most 
difficult to handle, the Civilization of Ruin,</b>

03:17.337 --> 03:18.217
<b>Mynoghra.</b>

03:18.217 --> 03:24.727
<b>Mynoghra</b>

03:18.217 --> 03:24.727
<b>Atou</b>

03:18.217 --> 03:24.727
<b>Ira Takuto</b>

03:18.657 --> 03:23.787
<b>You're the legendary player proudly shining 
at the top of the official user rankings,</b>

03:23.787 --> 03:24.727
<b>Ira Takuto!</b>

03:24.987 --> 03:26.977
<b>Huh?! H-How?!</b>

03:27.347 --> 03:30.437
<b>I remember everything too.</b>

03:30.817 --> 03:33.407
<b>Everything you said to me,</b>

03:33.407 --> 03:36.487
<b>how we conquered the world 
together many times,</b>

03:36.487 --> 03:39.197
<b>how we hit a game over many times...</b>

03:39.197 --> 03:41.077
<b>I remember it all.</b>

03:42.157 --> 03:43.947
<b>So please don't worry.</b>

03:43.947 --> 03:47.667
<b>I remember you, King Takuto.</b>

03:49.137 --> 03:50.627
<b>You...</b>

03:51.177 --> 03:54.967
<b>Using you was my play style.</b>

03:55.307 --> 03:59.177
<b>Maybe because I hoped I could 
become strong like you did.</b>

03:59.827 --> 04:02.807
<b>I'm so happy I can actually talk to you.</b>

04:02.807 --> 04:04.197
<b>Me too.</b>

04:04.197 --> 04:07.267
<b>Being to able to talk with 
you is an unexpected joy.</b>

04:08.097 --> 04:09.857
<b>Is this heaven?</b>

04:10.487 --> 04:12.847
<b>Did you summon me here?</b>

04:12.847 --> 04:13.567
<b>No.</b>

04:13.877 --> 04:16.617
<b>I found myself here in the blink of an eye.</b>

04:16.617 --> 04:20.037
<b>I've concluded that this isn't quite heaven.</b>

04:20.377 --> 04:23.787
<b>If I had to say, it feels more...</b>

04:24.137 --> 04:27.747
<b>similar to the world of <i>Eternal Nations</i>.</b>

04:28.387 --> 04:30.747
<b>An unfamiliar world?</b>

04:31.167 --> 04:35.047
<b>Would it be cliché to call this a miracle?</b>

04:35.707 --> 04:36.707
<b>Still,</b>

04:36.707 --> 04:40.767
<b>I'm just so happy to finally 
meet you in person, King Takuto.</b>

04:42.487 --> 04:46.087
<b>King Takuto, shall we get 
started together once more?</b>

04:46.087 --> 04:47.017
<b>Huh?</b>

04:47.017 --> 04:49.517
<b>We don't know where we are.</b>

04:49.517 --> 04:51.897
<b>Is this the world of <i>Eternal Nations</i>?</b>

04:51.897 --> 04:54.857
<b>Perhaps the world that you're from?</b>

04:54.857 --> 04:57.157
<b>Maybe it's an entirely different world.</b>

04:57.607 --> 05:00.617
<b>But just as we've done 
all those times before,</b>

05:01.247 --> 05:03.007
<b>let's get started together.</b>

05:03.007 --> 05:05.827
<b>Let's build a kingdom just for me and you!</b>

05:06.587 --> 05:08.167
<b>A kingdom...</b>

05:08.687 --> 05:11.067
<b><i>I have no idea what's going on here.</i></b>

05:11.067 --> 05:13.627
<b><i>I don't know even know where "here" is.</i></b>

05:15.587 --> 05:19.447
<b><i>But since we're together, let's do it again.</i></b>

05:19.447 --> 05:23.557
<b><i>Let's recreate those bright 
days in this world.</i></b>

05:24.137 --> 05:25.387
<b>Atou.</b>

05:25.657 --> 05:27.637
<b>Yes, my king?</b>

05:28.487 --> 05:30.647
<b>Let's build our civilization.</b>

05:30.647 --> 05:33.067
<b>A kingdom just for me and you!</b>

05:36.197 --> 05:41.297
<b>My name is Sludge Atou, the child born from 
the sludge that will destroy the world.</b>

05:41.297 --> 05:44.537
<b>From this moment on, my body 
and mind are yours to command.</b>

05:44.537 --> 05:50.377
Ira Takuto

05:44.537 --> 05:50.377
Mynoghra

05:44.537 --> 05:50.377
Alignment

05:44.537 --> 05:50.377
Evil

05:44.537 --> 05:50.377
Difficulty

05:44.967 --> 05:49.817
<b>Now, let us sink as low as 
we can together, my king!</b>

05:53.017 --> 05:55.737
<b>Man, doing this is kind of embarrassing, huh?</b>

05:55.737 --> 05:58.217
<b>It was a little embarrassing for me too.</b>

06:03.047 --> 06:06.077
<b>Well then, my one and only subordinate,</b>

06:06.077 --> 06:08.557
<b>my confidante and right-hand woman!</b>

06:08.967 --> 06:11.257
<b>Our civilization is lauded 
as the most evil nation of all,</b>

06:11.257 --> 06:13.767
<b>while being finicky and
 hyper-specialized in domestic affairs,</b>

06:13.767 --> 06:15.937
<b>so you know what our Mynoghra</b>

06:15.937 --> 06:17.527
<b>must do first, right?</b>

06:17.527 --> 06:19.657
<b>Of course, my king!</b>

06:20.257 --> 06:21.527
<b>We're becoming shut-ins!</b>

06:21.527 --> 06:23.447
<b>Let's close ourselves off!</b>

06:23.887 --> 06:25.267
<b>Yeah!</b>

06:26.897 --> 06:29.037
<b>Emergency Production! Scout!</b>

06:34.997 --> 06:36.797
<b>Emergency 
Production</b>

06:34.997 --> 06:36.797
<b>Scout Unit
Long-legged Bug</b>

06:38.647 --> 06:39.847
<b>Disgusting.</b>

06:39.847 --> 06:41.297
<b>So disgusting.</b>

06:41.297 --> 06:46.227
<b>Our Mynoghra is a mild-mannered 
civilization that governs evil and ruin.</b>

06:46.227 --> 06:48.797
<b>So we have to first keep that 
in mind as we take action.</b>

06:48.797 --> 06:52.667
<b>Meaning we want to avoid others 
discovering us as much as possible.</b>

06:52.667 --> 06:54.887
<b>That's our iron-clad rule in the early game!</b>

06:54.887 --> 06:59.147
<b>That's right! We need to gather information 
without being discovered by anyone.</b>

06:59.147 --> 07:01.317
<b>All right, Long-legged Bug!</b>

07:01.817 --> 07:05.277
<b>I'm giving you orders as a subordinate 
of the glorious Mynoghra!</b>

07:05.697 --> 07:08.417
<b>Go check out the area around us.</b>

07:08.417 --> 07:11.457
<b>Do not disappoint your 
great king, Ira Takuto,</b>

07:11.457 --> 07:14.147
<b>and see that you complete your mission.</b>

07:17.417 --> 07:19.677
<b>I was a little concerned,</b>

07:19.677 --> 07:22.677
<b>but it seems to be functioning as 
a proper unit under my command.</b>

07:22.977 --> 07:23.907
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:23.907 --> 07:27.927
<b>It seems I can share its vision to some 
extent too, just like in the game.</b>

07:28.257 --> 07:31.457
<b>That expended 100 Mana, so we have 100 left.</b>

07:29.427 --> 07:47.327
Emergency 
Production

07:30.177 --> 07:47.327
{100 MP Expended

07:31.457 --> 07:35.947
<b>Building a Settlement to serve as our 
initial base will consume 20 Mana.</b>

07:31.557 --> 07:47.327
{Planned

07:32.057 --> 07:47.327
Starting Settlement
 20 MP Expended

07:35.947 --> 07:38.867
<b>Emergency Production does have a high cost.</b>

07:38.867 --> 07:41.197
<b>We can't afford to waste any more.</b>

07:41.197 --> 07:44.857
<b>Honestly, I wanted to produce a 
Warrior that could fight for us,</b>

07:41.197 --> 07:47.327
Warrior

07:44.857 --> 07:47.327
<b>but that wasn't an option with our Mana.</b>

07:47.607 --> 07:50.787
<b>I'll just fight hard if we face combat!</b>

07:50.787 --> 07:52.657
<b>Or so I would like to say, but...</b>

07:52.657 --> 07:57.197
<b>The Hero unit, Atou, will grow 
stronger as time passes,</b>

07:57.197 --> 07:59.667
<b>but your current Strength is 3.</b>

07:59.667 --> 08:03.757
<b>That means that right now, Mynoghra is 
in the incredibly risky position where</b>

08:03.757 --> 08:09.637
<b>any encounter with a powerful enemy 
could mean its complete destruction.</b>

08:10.017 --> 08:12.127
<b>The difficulty's high.</b>

08:12.127 --> 08:14.447
<b>Please cheer up, my king.</b>

08:19.177 --> 08:20.657
<b>How is it going?</b>

08:20.657 --> 08:21.547
<b>Well.</b>

08:21.547 --> 08:24.397
<b>I've been able to grasp 
the surrounding terrain.</b>

08:24.777 --> 08:27.227
<b>Though it's all forest.</b>

08:27.227 --> 08:29.867
<b>It hasn't encountered any 
animals or monsters either.</b>

08:30.217 --> 08:33.287
<b>Forest Terrain is perfect for hiding in.</b>

08:33.287 --> 08:35.577
<b>Though it's quite odd that 
there aren't any animals.</b>

08:35.957 --> 08:38.417
<b>There isn't anything to serve as food either,</b>

08:38.417 --> 08:41.547
<b>but I'll keep scouting for a while.</b>

08:42.087 --> 08:45.007
<b>I'm sorry I can't be more helpful.</b>

08:46.037 --> 08:46.897
<b>It's fine.</b>

08:46.897 --> 08:49.637
<b>Just having you here with me is nice.</b>

08:52.597 --> 08:54.537
<b>M-My king!</b>

08:54.537 --> 08:57.047
<b>I'm incredibly moved right now!</b>

08:57.047 --> 08:58.187
<b>Y-Yeah?</b>

08:58.187 --> 08:59.687
<b>I'm glad.</b>

09:00.257 --> 09:02.717
<b><i>It was hard to tell in the game,</i></b>

09:02.717 --> 09:05.647
<b><i>but I guess this is what 
Atou's personality is like?</i></b>

09:07.657 --> 09:09.617
<b>A community of Dark Elves?</b>

09:11.327 --> 09:13.447
<b>It's not that far from here.</b>

09:13.897 --> 09:15.907
<b>I can see several gathered together.</b>

09:18.207 --> 09:22.417
<b>I suppose that means this is a fantasy world?</b>

09:22.867 --> 09:25.847
<b>Dark Elves tend to be neutral,
but lean neutral evil,</b>

09:25.847 --> 09:27.637
<b>so that's a bit of a relief.</b>

09:27.637 --> 09:30.927
<b>Do you think this is the world 
of <i>Eternal Nations</i> after all?</b>

09:31.247 --> 09:35.017
<b>If there's another civilization's 
Settlement, then that's bad for us.</b>

09:35.017 --> 09:37.217
<b>We want to avoid war if possible,</b>

09:37.217 --> 09:39.647
<b>which is why we want to 
stay hidden at the start.</b>

09:39.647 --> 09:42.237
<b>Being neighbors to another civilization</b>

09:42.237 --> 09:44.087
<b>would be most troubling.</b>

09:44.087 --> 09:46.277
<b>It'd be a shitty starting position for sure.</b>

09:46.277 --> 09:48.887
<b>If that proves true, then 
let's flee together.</b>

09:48.887 --> 09:49.937
<b>True.</b>

09:49.937 --> 09:52.867
<b>Mynoghra loves peace and harmony, after all.</b>

09:52.867 --> 09:53.867
<b>Yes.</b>

09:53.867 --> 09:56.707
<b>War is barbaric anyway.</b>

09:58.317 --> 10:02.917
<b>First, let's observe these Dark Elves while 
gathering more information on our surroundings.</b>

09:58.317 --> 10:04.417
<b>Clap, clap.</b>

10:02.917 --> 10:04.417
<b>If we're not in luck, 
then let's run far away.</b>

10:04.417 --> 10:06.407
<b>It'll be just us, fleeing together!</b>

10:06.407 --> 10:08.127
<b>As you wish, my king!</b>

10:20.077 --> 10:22.277
<b>Dark Elves?!</b>

10:32.337 --> 10:34.787
<b>There's really nothing here?</b>

10:35.787 --> 10:37.297
<b>Head Warrior Gia,</b>

10:37.297 --> 10:39.507
<b>I think we should leave the Accursed Lands...</b>

10:39.507 --> 10:42.167
<b>What good would leaving the forest now do?</b>

10:42.167 --> 10:44.357
<b>We've been driven off of our land,</b>

10:44.357 --> 10:46.417
<b>and we have nowhere left to go.</b>

10:47.147 --> 10:49.797
<b>I can't imagine our children will 
be able to last much longer.</b>

10:50.267 --> 10:52.507
<b>This place is so abundant with vegetation.</b>

10:52.507 --> 10:54.457
<b>There has to be food here.</b>

10:54.457 --> 10:58.167
<b>At the edge of Idoragya’s Uncharted Territory</b>

10:58.167 --> 10:59.807
<b>lies a vast, cursed forest—</b>

10:59.807 --> 11:01.017
<b>the Accursed Lands.</b>

11:01.017 --> 11:06.477
<b>It's written in our books that something 
evil was sealed away in those lands.</b>

11:06.477 --> 11:10.347
<b>Whatever that is would never 
allow life to flourish.</b>

11:11.927 --> 11:13.317
<b>That's just superstition, Emle.</b>

11:13.847 --> 11:16.827
<b>You can see how well the 
trees are growing here.</b>

11:17.387 --> 11:18.647
<b>Don't give up.</b>

11:18.647 --> 11:20.407
<b>You can't let yourself give up.</b>

11:20.757 --> 11:23.817
<b>Our proud spirit and the 
ghosts of our ancestors</b>

11:23.817 --> 11:28.077
<b>are sure to show us the way 
to overcome this hardship.</b>

11:28.077 --> 11:28.877
<b>Yes!</b>

11:31.477 --> 11:33.717
<b><i>It certainly is a creepy forest, though.</i></b>

11:34.327 --> 11:36.007
<b><i>"Something evil," huh?</i></b>

11:36.557 --> 11:39.267
<b><i>I can't leave over a reason like that.</i></b>

11:39.267 --> 11:41.477
<b><i>My people are waiting for me.</i></b>

11:41.477 --> 11:44.977
<b><i>Those of us who can still 
move have to find food.</i></b>

11:50.027 --> 11:51.857
<b><i>This is bad!</i></b>

11:53.077 --> 11:56.027
<b><i>That creature's no good!</i></b>

11:56.347 --> 11:58.987
<b><i>It's the manifestation of evil!</i></b>

11:59.547 --> 12:03.287
<b><i>My actions could affect the 
fate of my entire tribe.</i></b>

12:04.167 --> 12:05.747
<b><i>I must be careful.</i></b>

12:11.107 --> 12:14.427
<b>I am a Dark Elf of the Mazaram Clan,</b>

12:14.427 --> 12:17.467
<b>the head warrior, Gia Nageeve!</b>

12:18.017 --> 12:20.497
<b>I see that you are a highly 
esteemed individual!</b>

12:20.497 --> 12:24.937
<b>So first, please allow me to apologize for 
entering your forest without permission!</b>

12:25.457 --> 12:30.287
<b>Good. It seems you have sufficient 
understanding of what it means to enter these lands,</b>

12:30.287 --> 12:31.647
<b>dark fae.</b>

12:31.647 --> 12:35.857
<b>So, what reason compelled you 
to commit such trespass?</b>

12:37.927 --> 12:41.937
<b>My clan of Dark Elves, the Mazaram Clan,</b>

12:41.937 --> 12:46.207
<b>once resided in the central 
lands of Idoragya.</b>

12:46.827 --> 12:53.707
<b>However, our former leaders, the highest 
authority of the elves, the Tetrarchy Council—</b>

12:47.607 --> 12:50.967
<b><i>I'm a little relieved they 
seem to understand me.</i></b>

12:55.037 --> 12:56.887
<b>Keep it brief.</b>

12:56.887 --> 13:00.457
<b>W-We were persecuted and 
driven from our lands.</b>

13:00.457 --> 13:02.347
<b>With nowhere else to go, we 
made our way here...</b>

13:02.757 --> 13:03.967
<b><i>Crap!</i></b>

13:03.967 --> 13:08.807
<b><i>It was a mistake to try and portray 
our circumstances in a better light!</i></b>

13:08.807 --> 13:09.897
<b>You're emaciated, aren't you?</b>

13:11.567 --> 13:13.687
<b>My king is speaking to you.</b>

13:13.687 --> 13:16.127
<b>Th-The persecution was intense,</b>

13:16.127 --> 13:18.547
<b>and we came to this land to escape it.</b>

13:18.547 --> 13:22.007
<b>We ran out of food along the way, and since 
we wanted to throw off our pursuers,</b>

13:22.007 --> 13:24.677
<b>we haven't been able to secure more food.</b>

13:24.677 --> 13:27.167
<b>It's been several days 
since we last ate anything.</b>

13:30.657 --> 13:31.837
<b><i>Why?!</i></b>

13:32.257 --> 13:35.897
<b><i>Why did we have to be put 
through all this suffering?!</i></b>

13:35.897 --> 13:38.377
<b><i>What did we ever do to deserve it?!</i></b>

13:38.377 --> 13:41.757
<b><i>All we wanted was a place to live in peace!</i></b>

13:42.227 --> 13:46.687
<b><i>Is our desire to live that great a crime?!</i></b>

13:53.137 --> 13:55.107
<b><i>This sweet fragrance...</i></b>

13:55.437 --> 13:56.567
<b>They're yours.</b>

13:58.827 --> 14:00.917
<b>Are you familiar with apples?</b>

14:00.917 --> 14:03.307
<b>They're delicious when you 
cut them in the shape of bunnies.</b>

14:04.817 --> 14:06.157
<b>Apples?</b>

14:06.157 --> 14:09.997
<b>No, they're different from any 
fruit that I'm familiar with.</b>

14:10.567 --> 14:11.847
<b><i>What do I do?</i></b>

14:11.847 --> 14:14.727
<b><i>Would it be rude to sample 
one right here?</i></b>

14:14.727 --> 14:18.097
<b><i>Could I do that when our people 
are waiting for our return?</i></b>

14:18.097 --> 14:19.507
<b>It's good!</b>

14:19.507 --> 14:22.507
<b>It's incredibly sweet! And juicy too!</b>

14:23.527 --> 14:24.867
<b>I have pears too.</b>

14:24.867 --> 14:25.747
<b>Pears?</b>

14:27.657 --> 14:28.887
<b>You there.</b>

14:29.717 --> 14:31.367
<b>What's the matter?</b>

14:31.367 --> 14:34.187
<b>My king is offering you his charity.</b>

14:41.637 --> 14:44.277
<b>There are others like me 
who have fled to this land.</b>

14:44.777 --> 14:47.207
<b>We have small children with us.</b>

14:47.207 --> 14:50.247
<b>The children—our children are starving.</b>

14:50.917 --> 14:52.677
<b>They haven't eaten anything for days,</b>

14:52.677 --> 14:54.337
<b>and they've all grown very thin.</b>

14:54.767 --> 14:57.957
<b>This fruit that you have given 
us in your generous mercy...</b>

14:58.267 --> 15:01.897
<b>I would like to give it to our 
children instead of myself.</b>

15:03.337 --> 15:04.187
<b>Please.</b>

15:05.467 --> 15:06.787
<b>Poor things.</b>

15:06.787 --> 15:07.847
<b>King Takuto?!</b>

15:14.327 --> 15:17.867
<b><i>Dark Elves are scorned as beings 
who have fled from the light.</i></b>

15:18.987 --> 15:23.447
<b><i>They say we're only permitted to live thanks 
to the mercy of the Elves, the Fae of Light.</i></b>

15:24.307 --> 15:29.497
<b><i>We were subjected to that contempt and 
forced to live in the shadows, away from the light.</i></b>

15:30.377 --> 15:34.287
<b><i>No one ever reached out to 
offer us a helping hand.</i></b>

15:37.817 --> 15:39.047
<b>It's yours.</b>

15:39.047 --> 15:40.157
<b>It's a miracle!</b>

15:40.157 --> 15:41.217
<b>With this much food...!</b>

15:41.217 --> 15:42.547
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

15:42.937 --> 15:45.047
<b>Who exactly are you?</b>

15:45.927 --> 15:46.927
<b>It's yours.</b>

15:52.647 --> 15:54.347
<b>Come on, hang in there.</b>

15:54.757 --> 15:58.317
<b>Head Warrior Gia will 
surely find food for us.</b>

16:03.857 --> 16:05.487
<b>What is this scent?</b>

16:06.727 --> 16:07.947
<b>I have returned!</b>

16:08.757 --> 16:10.537
<b>I found food!</b>

16:10.837 --> 16:12.307
<b>Prepare the food!</b>

16:18.397 --> 16:19.877
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

16:27.177 --> 16:30.427
<b>Where did you manage to get this much food?</b>

16:30.427 --> 16:33.397
<b>I just happened to find it.</b>

16:49.697 --> 16:52.147
<b>You've done good work today.</b>

16:53.527 --> 16:54.887
<b>Elder Moltar.</b>

16:58.627 --> 17:02.267
<b>The fruit you've brought 
back with you is incredible.</b>

17:02.267 --> 17:04.487
<b>I'm confident that I've lived a long life,</b>

17:04.487 --> 17:06.467
<b>and even I'd never seen anything like it.</b>

17:06.767 --> 17:07.947
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:07.947 --> 17:11.497
<b>I sampled a little of it, and it's exquisite.</b>

17:11.997 --> 17:15.937
<b>It's my first time learning that such 
tasty fruit exists in this world.</b>

17:15.937 --> 17:18.897
<b>Did something happen?</b>

17:22.617 --> 17:26.197
<b>I encountered a legendary 
being deep in the forest.</b>

17:26.197 --> 17:28.407
<b>What kind of legend?</b>

17:28.407 --> 17:31.127
<b>I remember Emle mentioned something</b>

17:31.127 --> 17:34.867
<b>about some being that was sealed 
away in the Accursed Lands?</b>

17:34.867 --> 17:37.277
<b>You met the King of Ruin?!</b>

17:37.277 --> 17:38.497
<b>You know about him?</b>

17:39.347 --> 17:43.297
<b>Some of the legends and old books remain.</b>

17:43.777 --> 17:46.007
<b>"When the world reaches saturation,</b>

17:46.007 --> 17:48.087
<b>the King of Ruin will appear.</b>

17:48.087 --> 17:50.307
<b>He will bring ruin to any and all,</b>

17:50.307 --> 17:53.137
<b>forcing all to start over from scratch."</b>

17:53.667 --> 17:55.527
<b>It's unclear how true that may be,</b>

17:55.527 --> 17:57.737
<b>but I can't declare it a lie.</b>

17:58.307 --> 18:00.537
<b>Did he call himself that?</b>

18:00.537 --> 18:02.237
<b>He didn't give a name.</b>

18:02.237 --> 18:04.957
<b>But the King of Ruin, huh?</b>

18:04.957 --> 18:08.107
<b>He was certainly terrifying 
enough to warrant that name.</b>

18:08.407 --> 18:10.737
<b>Did you talk to this king?</b>

18:10.737 --> 18:12.807
<b>No, the king...</b>

18:12.807 --> 18:16.447
<b>was a being that seemed 
beyond our understanding.</b>

18:16.887 --> 18:19.417
<b>However, he had a young woman serving him.</b>

18:19.697 --> 18:23.427
<b>She clarified the king's 
words to some degree.</b>

18:24.377 --> 18:29.147
<b>I'm not sure if the being you 
met was the King of Ruin.</b>

18:29.147 --> 18:32.367
<b>Though it's clear he's not something good.</b>

18:33.387 --> 18:38.887
<b>Now that I've filled my stomach and 
recovered a bit of Mana, I can tell.</b>

18:39.767 --> 18:41.727
<b>This forest is abnormal.</b>

18:42.107 --> 18:45.107
<b>Perhaps I should have noticed sooner.</b>

18:45.107 --> 18:48.107
<b>Did you give him anything 
in exchange for the food?</b>

18:48.987 --> 18:49.917
<b>Nothing.</b>

18:51.167 --> 18:55.577
<b>Like an evil being would grant charity 
without demanding anything in return.</b>

18:55.577 --> 18:57.017
<b>I don't know.</b>

18:57.017 --> 18:59.897
<b>I just explained our 
situation when they asked.</b>

18:59.897 --> 19:01.237
<b>That's all.</b>

19:01.237 --> 19:04.167
<b>Why would the King of Ruin do such a thing?</b>

19:06.827 --> 19:07.627
<b>Grace.</b>

19:07.927 --> 19:09.967
<b>"Grace," you say?</b>

19:10.237 --> 19:11.987
<b>Yeah, grace.</b>

19:12.647 --> 19:15.507
<b>His Grace sympathized 
with our situation</b>

19:15.507 --> 19:17.197
<b>and granted us charity.</b>

19:17.197 --> 19:18.427
<b>You!</b>

19:18.867 --> 19:21.007
<b>Did you just call him "His Grace"?</b>

19:21.007 --> 19:22.467
<b>Have you been charmed by him?!</b>

19:22.467 --> 19:23.557
<b>Absolutely not!</b>

19:23.557 --> 19:27.127
<b>Then why would you be so rash as 
to call him "His Grace"?!</b>

19:27.127 --> 19:30.277
<b>That title is used to show respect!</b>

19:30.547 --> 19:33.917
<b>His Grace granted us aid!</b>

19:33.917 --> 19:35.407
<b>When we were starving!</b>

19:35.407 --> 19:37.647
<b>It's only natural to show him respect!</b>

19:37.647 --> 19:40.367
<b>But we're talking about an evil being!</b>

19:40.367 --> 19:41.577
<b>Then what?!</b>

19:41.577 --> 19:43.077
<b>What was I supposed to do?!</b>

19:43.607 --> 19:47.547
<b>We're only able to waste our 
strength arguing like this</b>

19:48.207 --> 19:51.047
<b>because His Grace filled our stomachs!</b>

19:53.027 --> 19:55.007
<b>Hey, Elder Moltar.</b>

19:55.847 --> 19:57.847
<b>What should I have done?</b>

19:58.407 --> 20:01.557
<b>Even I don't know the answer to that.</b>

20:02.007 --> 20:06.107
<b>I'm sorry, Gia, brave warrior of our tribe.</b>

20:06.587 --> 20:08.657
<b>You've done well.</b>

20:09.767 --> 20:14.407
<b>I'll handle negotiations with the 
king as the leader of the Dark Elves.</b>

20:14.707 --> 20:17.887
<b>I've been alive for two centuries now.</b>

20:17.887 --> 20:19.847
<b>I'll figure something out.</b>

20:19.847 --> 20:20.867
<b>Please do.</b>

20:21.447 --> 20:27.247
<b>I wonder when we'll be able 
to spend our nights in peace.</b>

20:30.567 --> 20:31.927
<b>I wonder when, too.</b>

20:34.177 --> 20:36.137
<b>King Takuto, sit up straight!</b>

20:37.357 --> 20:41.057
<b>How could you use our scarce
Mana on something like that?!</b>

20:41.057 --> 20:44.317
<b>I-I just felt bad for them...</b>

20:44.317 --> 20:46.437
<b>Not good enough!</b>

20:46.727 --> 20:48.967
<b>We just got Mynoghra started.</b>

20:48.967 --> 20:51.187
<b>We don't even know what's 
going on around us yet.</b>

20:51.187 --> 20:51.897
<b>Hmph!</b>

20:51.897 --> 20:55.097
<b>I'm sorry for using our Mana without asking.</b>

20:55.097 --> 20:56.747
<b>Atou, please stop being mad.</b>

20:56.747 --> 21:00.737
<b>Hmph! It's not like I'm mad about it.</b>

21:01.197 --> 21:04.827
<b>Okay. Then I'll do anything you ask of me.</b>

21:05.337 --> 21:09.357
<b>"A-Anything" is going too far, isn't it?</b>

21:09.357 --> 21:12.247
<b>You don't have to promise 
that. I'm not really...</b>

21:14.237 --> 21:16.737
<b>I need you, Atou.</b>

21:17.427 --> 21:19.877
<b>I'm sorry for saying such mean things!</b>

21:19.877 --> 21:24.517
<b>I'm a failure of a subordinate for voicing 
dissent about my great king's decision!</b>

21:24.517 --> 21:26.977
<b>Please command whatever you wish from me!</b>

21:26.977 --> 21:27.987
<b>Yeah...</b>

21:27.987 --> 21:30.477
<b>Actually, um...</b>

21:30.477 --> 21:33.627
<b>I wasn't able to speak with 
those Dark Elves very well.</b>

21:33.627 --> 21:34.437
<b>Huh?!</b>

21:34.897 --> 21:37.587
<b>I'm able to talk to you just fine,</b>

21:37.587 --> 21:39.407
<b>but the words just won't come out</b>

21:39.407 --> 21:42.257
<b>when I'm in front of others.</b>

21:42.817 --> 21:45.397
<b>I thought that was just you 
role-playing the idea that</b>

21:45.397 --> 21:48.997
<b>the strong disdain long speeches and leave 
the detailed negotiations to their subordinates?</b>

21:50.527 --> 21:53.517
<b>Apparently, I'm just awkward.</b>

21:54.707 --> 21:56.277
<b>My king!</b>

21:54.707 --> 21:59.237
<b>That reminds me... I don't recall any nice chats 
with the nurses or doctors at the hospital either...</b>

21:56.277 --> 21:58.087
<b>Please don't cry!</b>

21:58.087 --> 21:59.677
<b>It's just, you know, you stand above it!</b>

21:59.237 --> 22:02.277
<b>and I rarely had the chance 
to chat with anyone...</b>

21:59.677 --> 22:01.447
<b>Kings are meant to stand above the masses!</b>

22:01.447 --> 22:05.057
<b>They typically only talk with 
subordinates that they trust!</b>

22:02.277 --> 22:05.057
<b>If I can't talk to anyone I'm 
not close to, then I'm screwed...</b>
